WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:00.800
Hi,

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.750
I'm Anirudh.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.500
This video is about the player it's playing in.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.450
It has one trick:

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.050
when I finish a step,

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.080
it stops and waits for you. Watch.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.100
You're back.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.860
Now say your hands are covered with flour.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.280
On the phone,

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.120
turn on Knock twice and knock on the table.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.900
On the computer,

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.260
turn on the mic and say “next”.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:25.780
I'll wait.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.380
Missed something?

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.840
Tap Repeat and I'll do it all again.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.400
Tap Slower and I'll do it half the speed,

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.700
which is how I do most of the things anyway.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.280
On a computer,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.500
just

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.420
say it.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.180
One corner shows you which step you are on.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.620
On a phone, tap the other corner: I fill the screen,

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.160
the text gets larger

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.880
and the screen stays awake.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.680
Lost on a computer?

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.400
Say “step two”.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.020
Don't like being waited on?

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.220
Flip the Wait switch off and I'm a normal video player.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.860
I won't take it personally.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.180
That's Stepwise.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:07.940
Go make something.
